WEBVTT

00:00:02.020 --> 00:00:03.580
Summer grasses grow,

00:00:03.580 --> 00:00:05.000
leaving but the dreams of the

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:06.610
long-gone warriors.

00:00:07.250 --> 00:00:11.500
The dream of unifying Japan was held 
by many lords of the warring states.

00:00:13.490 --> 00:00:15.170
Shingen Takeda.

00:00:15.970 --> 00:00:17.910
Kenshin Uesugi.

00:00:18.230 --> 00:00:19.830
Nobunaga Oda.

00:00:20.770 --> 00:00:25.210
And finally, one man had attained that dream...

00:00:25.210 --> 00:00:26.930
Hideyoshi Toyotomi.

00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:29.000
Japan had been unified,

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:32.060
and a time of peace appeared to be at hand.

00:00:32.060 --> 00:00:33.200
However,

00:00:34.640 --> 00:00:39.380
chaos was to rear its ugly head once more.

00:02:15.520 --> 00:02:16.940
My lord...

00:02:17.860 --> 00:02:19.490
Everyone is here to see you.

00:02:21.260 --> 00:02:22.740
Lord Hideyoshi.

00:02:33.860 --> 00:02:35.850
M-Mitsunari...

00:02:36.780 --> 00:02:38.510
Lord Ieyasu...

00:02:39.700 --> 00:02:41.010
Lord Hideyoshi!

00:02:41.370 --> 00:02:46.160
Please take care of...

00:02:47.010 --> 00:02:50.780
the Toyotomi and my son, Hideyori...

00:02:50.780 --> 00:02:52.310
Of course!

00:02:52.310 --> 00:02:54.860
We'll protect the Toyotomi, no matter what!

00:02:57.850 --> 00:02:59.650
Men...

00:03:01.650 --> 00:03:04.360
I'm counting on you...

00:03:06.740 --> 00:03:08.010
My lord?

00:03:08.540 --> 00:03:10.210
My lord!

00:03:10.210 --> 00:03:12.280
My lord!

00:03:19.050 --> 00:03:21.510
My lord!

00:03:27.180 --> 00:03:28.310
Lord Hideyoshi!

00:03:43.570 --> 00:03:44.820
Where are you going?

00:03:46.120 --> 00:03:48.300
There's still work to be done.

00:03:48.300 --> 00:03:49.580
How dare you?

00:03:49.860 --> 00:03:51.490
Don't you realize what has just happened?

00:03:52.090 --> 00:03:54.120
How can you stay calm in this situation?

00:03:54.530 --> 00:03:55.590
Masanori...

00:03:56.620 --> 00:03:58.230
Our lord just died!

00:03:58.230 --> 00:04:00.760
How about shedding a tear for him, huh?

00:04:01.200 --> 00:04:03.630
Why won't you cry?

00:04:03.890 --> 00:04:05.280
Our lord is...

00:04:05.280 --> 00:04:09.380
Our lord is gone!

00:04:27.870 --> 00:04:29.130
Lord Mitsunari.

00:04:29.800 --> 00:04:35.290
Please... Please take care of Katsuyori!

00:04:42.180 --> 00:04:45.300
We failed to defend the Takeda clan!

00:04:46.030 --> 00:04:51.690
That the Takeda should be wiped out, 
so soon after losing our lord...

00:04:53.450 --> 00:04:57.310
Brother, what will happen to the country now?

00:04:58.160 --> 00:05:00.500
No matter what the future brings,

00:05:00.500 --> 00:05:04.570
we will work together to defend the Sanada clan.

00:05:04.570 --> 00:05:05.570
Got that?

00:05:05.920 --> 00:05:07.880
Yes, Brother.

00:05:16.240 --> 00:05:21.870
<i>We shall never let Lord Mitsunari 
suffer the same agony we did.</i>

00:05:22.770 --> 00:05:27.060
<i>We will not let history repeat itself.</i>

00:05:30.740 --> 00:05:34.110
The death of Hideyoshi, unifier of Japan,

00:05:34.560 --> 00:05:39.120
meant that the Toyotomi rule 
had lost its mainstay.

00:05:39.940 --> 00:05:45.170
His trusted friend, Toshiie Maeda, 
also passed away soon after,

00:05:45.170 --> 00:05:49.100
throwing the Toyotomi into turmoil.

00:05:55.010 --> 00:05:57.670
Why isn't Lord Kagekatsu here?

00:05:57.670 --> 00:05:59.420
What's the meaning of this?

00:05:59.780 --> 00:06:03.670
My lord, Kagekatsu Uesugi, has returned to Aizu.

00:06:04.350 --> 00:06:05.960
This is an important conference

00:06:05.960 --> 00:06:10.930
to discuss the Toyotomi's future, 
given Lord Toshiie's death.

00:06:11.640 --> 00:06:15.060
Don't you think Lord Kagekatsu should 
have been personally attended?

00:06:15.390 --> 00:06:17.950
As you're aware, it was only recently

00:06:17.950 --> 00:06:20.560
that we, the Uesugi, had to relocate 
from Echigo to Aizu.

00:06:21.130 --> 00:06:23.970
We have yet to firmly establish 
power within our domain.

00:06:23.970 --> 00:06:25.110
On the other hand,

00:06:25.110 --> 00:06:27.920
I hear that you're using that as an excuse

00:06:27.920 --> 00:06:31.330
to build a new castle.

00:06:31.330 --> 00:06:34.300
It's almost as if you're preparing for war.

00:06:35.040 --> 00:06:36.080
War?

00:06:36.940 --> 00:06:42.330
Some say that Uesugi plans to 
rebel against the Toyotomi.

00:06:42.820 --> 00:06:45.340
I-Is that true, Kanetsugu?

00:06:45.740 --> 00:06:46.930
Of course not!

00:06:46.930 --> 00:06:49.130
Rebel? That's merely a baseless rumor!

00:06:49.840 --> 00:06:51.430
You're one to talk, Lord Ieyasu.

00:06:51.430 --> 00:06:54.850
I hear you have summoned various 
provincial lords to Edo.

00:06:55.700 --> 00:07:02.100
I can't help but think you're trying to take 
Lord Hideyoshi's place as ruler of all Japan.

00:07:03.980 --> 00:07:05.470
Nonsense.

00:07:05.470 --> 00:07:11.240
Lord Hideyoshi left the Toyotomi 
and Hideyori in my care.

00:07:11.980 --> 00:07:13.760
Please take care of...

00:07:14.350 --> 00:07:19.250
the Toyotomi and my son, Hideyori...

00:07:20.020 --> 00:07:26.720
I'm simply doing what I can to ensure 
the Toyotomi stay united.

00:07:26.720 --> 00:07:28.550
I cannot let that pass.

00:07:29.020 --> 00:07:33.640
You make it sound like you alone 
have inherited Hideyoshi's will.

00:07:34.540 --> 00:07:37.890
That is far too conceited.

00:07:38.350 --> 00:07:41.340
But what of you, Lord Mitsunari?

00:07:41.340 --> 00:07:44.370
You knew beforehand that Lord Kagekatsu

00:07:44.370 --> 00:07:46.980
wouldn't be attending this conference, correct?

00:07:46.980 --> 00:07:47.630
That's...

00:07:47.630 --> 00:07:49.060
Of course.

00:07:49.060 --> 00:07:51.780
I gave him my approval, since I 
saw no problem with it.

00:07:52.570 --> 00:07:55.780
What makes you think you 
have the right to do that?

00:07:56.230 --> 00:07:59.290
Lately, you've been making too 
many decisions by yourself.

00:07:59.810 --> 00:08:02.650
This is no time for such pointless babble.

00:08:02.650 --> 00:08:03.790
What was that?

00:08:05.010 --> 00:08:08.170
The Toyotomi clan doesn't 
belong to you alone!

00:08:17.730 --> 00:08:19.420
Wait, Mitsunari!

00:08:25.570 --> 00:08:26.600
What's going on?

00:08:28.040 --> 00:08:29.160
Kiyomasa,

00:08:29.690 --> 00:08:31.190
go to Kyushu.

00:08:31.550 --> 00:08:32.850
Kyushu?

00:08:33.530 --> 00:08:35.550
Prepare to head there at once.

00:08:35.550 --> 00:08:37.940
You're telling me to leave Osaka?

00:08:37.940 --> 00:08:39.330
Don't be stupid!

00:08:39.680 --> 00:08:44.050
The three of us have always been together, ever since we were kids!

00:08:44.050 --> 00:08:46.860
This is the time for us to work together to protect the Toyotomi

00:08:46.860 --> 00:08:49.250
from right here in Osaka!

00:08:50.180 --> 00:08:53.840
I'll see to the Toyotomi's future myself.

00:08:55.630 --> 00:08:58.090
Are you seriously trying to take our lord's place?

00:08:59.480 --> 00:09:00.580
Kiyomasa.

00:09:01.070 --> 00:09:02.390
This is an order.

00:09:03.420 --> 00:09:04.850
Mitsunari!

00:09:09.510 --> 00:09:10.960
Lord Masanori!

00:09:10.960 --> 00:09:12.310
Calm down!

00:09:15.160 --> 00:09:17.360
Are you done, Masanori?

00:09:18.120 --> 00:09:19.270
Say what?

00:09:19.270 --> 00:09:20.680
Mitsunari!

00:09:20.680 --> 00:09:25.360
You two have known my lord the longest. 
Surely you understand.

00:09:26.160 --> 00:09:30.130
It is because Mitsunari trusts you, Kiyomasa,

00:09:30.130 --> 00:09:33.170
that he wants to leave the all-important 
Kyushu's defense in your hands.

00:09:33.920 --> 00:09:36.130
I know that all too well!

00:09:36.780 --> 00:09:39.590
I just wanted to hear it from Mitsunari himself!

00:09:42.460 --> 00:09:43.320
Say something!

00:09:43.320 --> 00:09:44.600
And strike back!

00:09:44.600 --> 00:09:45.890
That's how we've always done things!

00:09:45.890 --> 00:09:48.600
We fought at times, but we've 
always stuck together!

00:09:52.270 --> 00:09:54.910
Our responsibilities are far heavier now.

00:09:59.390 --> 00:10:02.170
I won't take any orders from you.

00:10:02.170 --> 00:10:04.160
Goodbye, Mitsunari.

00:10:04.160 --> 00:10:05.900
K-Kiyomasa...

00:10:06.570 --> 00:10:07.700
Later.

00:10:07.700 --> 00:10:09.900
Please wait, Lord Kiyomasa...

00:10:09.900 --> 00:10:11.430
Lord Masanori!

00:10:16.410 --> 00:10:19.550
Why must you set off alone, Lady Nene?

00:10:20.110 --> 00:10:24.200
This place brings back too 
many memories of my lord.

00:10:24.840 --> 00:10:25.810
But...

00:10:27.360 --> 00:10:29.310
He loved you all, and for good reason.

00:10:30.170 --> 00:10:34.070
I know that I can count on you.

00:10:35.230 --> 00:10:37.570
Work together, and play nice, okay?

00:10:38.090 --> 00:10:42.820
This world full of smiles is my lord's 
legacy, and it's in your hands now.

00:10:43.250 --> 00:10:44.010
Yes, ma'am!

00:10:44.010 --> 00:10:45.670
Lady Nene...

00:10:57.130 --> 00:10:58.350
Lord Mitsunari.

00:11:02.090 --> 00:11:03.090
I see.

00:11:03.470 --> 00:11:06.040
So Lord Ieyasu returned to Edo.

00:11:06.040 --> 00:11:06.850
Yes.

00:11:10.890 --> 00:11:13.860
Lord Nobuyuki, is there something worrying you?

00:11:17.060 --> 00:11:20.850
The Takeda clan, whom we Sanada used to serve,

00:11:20.850 --> 00:11:25.590
fell into ruin soon after losing its lord.

00:11:26.220 --> 00:11:28.620
I will never forget the frustration and sorrow

00:11:29.020 --> 00:11:30.910
we were forced to endure.

00:11:33.450 --> 00:11:36.630
A house that loses its pillar of support 
will fall apart in no time.

00:11:37.370 --> 00:11:42.990
Are you saying that the Toyotomi and 
their rule will be plunged into turmoil,

00:11:42.990 --> 00:11:44.640
now that it has lost its pillar?

00:11:46.450 --> 00:11:49.390
I want to be that pillar for the Sanada.

00:11:49.390 --> 00:11:52.020
A pillar that will never crumble,

00:11:52.570 --> 00:11:55.600
even in the midst of chaos.

00:11:57.500 --> 00:12:02.010
It looks like Lord Kiyomasa and Lord 
Masanori have left the castle.

00:12:02.010 --> 00:12:02.900
Is that so?

00:12:03.610 --> 00:12:07.770
Lord Hideyoshi's death has hit 
Mitsunari harder than anyone.

00:12:07.770 --> 00:12:08.660
I know.

00:12:09.080 --> 00:12:11.500
The Takeda clan, whom we once served,

00:12:11.500 --> 00:12:14.410
died along with their lord.

00:12:15.110 --> 00:12:18.260
Lord Mitsunari must be doing all he can, to ensure

00:12:18.260 --> 00:12:20.420
the Toyotomi don't suffer the same fate.

00:12:21.220 --> 00:12:24.330
He's ready to carry the weight of 
the Toyotomi clan on his shoulders,

00:12:24.980 --> 00:12:27.960
but it's too heavy a burden to shoulder alone.

00:12:29.930 --> 00:12:32.810
We can't let him carry it by himself.

00:12:33.460 --> 00:12:34.380
Indeed.

00:12:37.360 --> 00:12:38.340
Mitsunari.

00:12:39.550 --> 00:12:42.970
You have a bad habit of getting 
too engrossed in your work.

00:12:42.970 --> 00:12:46.300
Lately, you haven't been sleeping 
or eating properly.

00:12:46.300 --> 00:12:50.830
Lord Hideyoshi may have died, 
but we cannot let administrative work pile up.

00:12:51.910 --> 00:12:54.490
Not a moment to rest, huh?

00:12:54.490 --> 00:12:57.080
Don't overdo it, though.

00:12:57.820 --> 00:12:59.590
I don't need you to tell me that.

00:13:17.350 --> 00:13:18.920
How meddlesome.

00:13:25.220 --> 00:13:26.500
It must be Sakon's doing.

00:13:27.140 --> 00:13:29.640
This crude rice ball is just like him.

00:13:33.680 --> 00:13:34.940
It's salty.

00:13:39.980 --> 00:13:41.860
I'm heading back to Numata.

00:13:42.780 --> 00:13:45.560
It's been left unattended long enough.

00:13:45.560 --> 00:13:46.050
Okay.

00:13:46.750 --> 00:13:48.300
Be careful, and have a safe journey.

00:13:48.790 --> 00:13:50.670
Until another time, Yukimura.

00:13:50.670 --> 00:13:51.610
Yes.

00:13:52.350 --> 00:13:54.180
Let us meet again in Shinano.

00:14:04.080 --> 00:14:05.330
Father?

00:14:07.320 --> 00:14:09.700
Lord Ieyasu has called for you.

00:14:20.790 --> 00:14:22.130
I'm sorry to have kept you waiting.

00:14:22.520 --> 00:14:23.550
Don't be.

00:14:23.550 --> 00:14:24.630
I'm glad you came.

00:14:25.140 --> 00:14:26.050
Sir!

00:14:27.600 --> 00:14:29.130
<i>Lord Takatora Todo,</i>

00:14:29.880 --> 00:14:31.660
<i>Lord Kiyomasa Kato,</i>

00:14:31.660 --> 00:14:33.140
<i>Lord Masanori Fukushima,</i>

00:14:33.750 --> 00:14:36.900
<i>and several other Toyotomi feudal lords.</i>

00:14:36.900 --> 00:14:37.890
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:14:39.310 --> 00:14:41.600
I thank you all for coming here today.

00:14:41.600 --> 00:14:42.900
Sir!

00:14:42.900 --> 00:14:46.360
Lord Hideyoshi brought an end 
to the long period of strife.

00:14:46.840 --> 00:14:49.110
And had the Toyotomi rule stayed that powerful,

00:14:49.550 --> 00:14:54.870
I would have been in Kanto now, 
further consolidating the nation.

00:14:55.980 --> 00:14:59.120
But Lord Hideyoshi passed away.

00:14:59.930 --> 00:15:02.880
His heir, Hideyori, is still young.

00:15:02.880 --> 00:15:06.880
It would be too hard for him to 
maintain this peace alone.

00:15:09.840 --> 00:15:12.890
We mustn't let the world be torn by war again!

00:15:13.570 --> 00:15:15.830
And yet, Aizu's Kagekatsu Uesugi

00:15:15.830 --> 00:15:18.650
is plotting rebellion against the Toyotomi!

00:15:18.650 --> 00:15:20.890
The country is in peril!

00:15:21.450 --> 00:15:24.000
Now is the time for us to work together

00:15:24.000 --> 00:15:26.150
and overcome this crisis!

00:15:26.500 --> 00:15:28.190
Will you join me, Ieyasu,

00:15:28.190 --> 00:15:30.650
in defeating the man who 
threatens our nation's peace,

00:15:31.050 --> 00:15:33.280
Kagekatsu?

00:15:33.820 --> 00:15:35.950
Yes!

00:15:37.210 --> 00:15:38.510
Fight the Uesugi?

00:15:41.280 --> 00:15:42.470
Father,

00:15:42.470 --> 00:15:44.710
back when Tokugawa and Sanada were at war,

00:15:44.980 --> 00:15:47.210
the Uesugi sided with the Sanada!

00:15:47.640 --> 00:15:50.210
The two houses have a strong bond!

00:15:50.730 --> 00:15:55.470
Father, you must leave Sanada out of 
the campaign against Uesugi!

00:16:12.650 --> 00:16:14.050
Lord Mitsunari...

00:16:14.680 --> 00:16:15.890
Have you made your decision?

00:16:16.490 --> 00:16:18.990
Ieyasu's targeting the innocent Uesugi

00:16:19.400 --> 00:16:21.860
because he intends to usurp 
the Toyotomi power

00:16:21.860 --> 00:16:24.140
from the rightful heir, Lord Hideyori.

00:16:24.850 --> 00:16:26.500
There is no justice in Ieyasu's cause.

00:16:28.230 --> 00:16:31.040
I will defeat him.

00:16:32.240 --> 00:16:36.300
In that case, we Uesugi will turn 
the tables on Ieyasu at Aizu!

00:16:36.300 --> 00:16:40.510
My brother and I will be at your service.

00:16:41.810 --> 00:16:46.050
Nobuyuki is part of the Tokugawa camp.

00:16:46.050 --> 00:16:48.400
M-My brother?

00:16:49.070 --> 00:16:51.560
He must have complied with 
the order to attack Uesugi.

00:16:51.560 --> 00:16:56.140
We owe a lot to the Uesugi. 
My brother would never turn on them.

00:16:56.140 --> 00:16:58.220
When he learns of your taking up arms,

00:16:58.220 --> 00:17:00.540
he will surely join me in fighting for you.

00:17:01.030 --> 00:17:02.490
That's right, Mitsunari!

00:17:02.490 --> 00:17:04.540
We'll fight with you!

00:17:05.010 --> 00:17:08.870
During the battle of Ueda, you two 
risked your lives to help me.

00:17:08.870 --> 00:17:14.550
I will cherish my bonds with you as long as I live!

00:17:18.930 --> 00:17:21.370
You're a fool, indeed.

00:17:21.370 --> 00:17:23.640
Let us share a vow of righteousness!

00:17:23.640 --> 00:17:24.560
Yes.

00:17:26.440 --> 00:17:27.810
Kanetsugu Naoe!

00:17:29.710 --> 00:17:31.070
Yukimura Sanada!

00:17:38.220 --> 00:17:40.070
Mitsunari Ishida!

00:17:40.430 --> 00:17:44.690
Together, we will defeat the enemy 
and bring victory to the just!

00:17:53.870 --> 00:17:55.220
Lord Nobuyuki...

00:17:56.140 --> 00:17:57.070
What is it?

00:17:57.950 --> 00:18:00.950
Lord Yukimura wants to see you.

00:18:02.230 --> 00:18:05.410
He said he'll be waiting at Inubushi.

00:18:07.550 --> 00:18:08.600
Very well.

00:18:17.820 --> 00:18:20.780
The brothers Nobuyuki and Yukimura

00:18:19.530 --> 00:18:23.530
Shimotsuke 

00:18:20.780 --> 00:18:25.860
would meet at Inubushi, 
in the Shimotsuke province.

00:18:32.310 --> 00:18:34.090
You've got a bite, Yukimura.

00:18:34.090 --> 00:18:35.870
R-Right!

00:18:37.770 --> 00:18:38.470
Yukimura!

00:18:39.790 --> 00:18:40.690
Let's do this!

00:18:40.690 --> 00:18:41.900
Got it!

00:19:06.390 --> 00:19:07.420
Brother...

00:19:09.790 --> 00:19:10.910
Yukimura.

00:19:13.450 --> 00:19:14.710
Brother,

00:19:14.710 --> 00:19:16.960
To Nobuyuki Sanada

00:19:15.160 --> 00:19:16.960
please read this.

00:19:17.440 --> 00:19:19.980
It's a letter from Lord Mitsunari.

00:19:19.980 --> 00:19:21.720
I don't need to read it to know what it's about.

00:19:22.080 --> 00:19:25.470
He wants the Sanada clan
to side with him, yes?

00:19:25.920 --> 00:19:28.390
Let's fight alongside him, Brother.

00:19:30.940 --> 00:19:32.520
I cannot accept that letter.

00:19:33.400 --> 00:19:34.850
Brother?

00:19:34.850 --> 00:19:35.970
Yukimura,

00:19:36.940 --> 00:19:40.030
I will side with the Tokugawa.

00:19:46.250 --> 00:19:47.130
Why?

00:19:47.130 --> 00:19:48.800
Tell me why, Brother!

00:19:49.850 --> 00:19:53.370
Don't you remember what happened 
to the Takeda clan once our lord died?

00:19:54.080 --> 00:19:56.980
The Toyotomi clan will suffer the same fate.

00:19:56.980 --> 00:19:58.520
We mustn't make the same mistake.

00:19:58.520 --> 00:20:00.880
No! We must fight with Lord Mitsunari,

00:20:01.290 --> 00:20:03.380
so we don't feel that pain again!

00:20:03.380 --> 00:20:05.220
Listen to me, Yukimura.

00:20:05.220 --> 00:20:08.390
Mitsunari won't be able to bring 
the Toyotomi clan under his control.

00:20:08.890 --> 00:20:12.130
Then we need only help him!

00:20:13.140 --> 00:20:14.370
Yukimura,

00:20:15.040 --> 00:20:16.910
let us fight together.

00:20:16.910 --> 00:20:20.930
Only Lord Ieyasu can bring an end to the 
strife, and create a land of peace.

00:20:20.930 --> 00:20:24.160
But is there justice in that cause?

00:20:28.850 --> 00:20:29.910
Brother...

00:20:40.640 --> 00:20:42.460
I will become a pillar,

00:20:43.600 --> 00:20:45.730
one that will never crumble.

00:20:46.310 --> 00:20:53.180
To protect the Sanada clan and for a 
peaceful world, I stand by Tokugawa.

00:20:54.400 --> 00:20:56.690
Join me, Yukimura.

00:20:59.890 --> 00:21:03.190
Sorry, but I must refuse.

00:21:06.490 --> 00:21:10.840
I cannot give up on my ideals.

00:21:10.840 --> 00:21:13.700
Even if it means making an enemy out of you,

00:21:14.080 --> 00:21:18.130
I shall fight righteously alongside Lord Mitsunari.

00:21:19.410 --> 00:21:20.860
I wish you luck.

